&lt;p&gt;Tech billionaire Elon Musk said on Monday that he would give every child in the United States a share in his SpaceX rocket company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Next year, I will give one of my SpaceX shares to every kid in America,” Musk, the richest man in the world, said on X.&lt;/p&gt;
